        "text": "Step 1: The formula for the projection of vector $\\mathbf{a}$ onto vector $\\mathbf{b}$ is given by\n\\[\n\\text{proj}_{\\mathbf{b}} \\mathbf{a} = \\frac{\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b}}{\\mathbf{b} \\cdot \\mathbf{b}} \\mathbf{b}.\n\\]"
