        "text": "Step 2: Given vectors are $\\mathbf{a} = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ y \\\\ -5 \\end{pmatrix}$ and $\\mathbf{b} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$, and the projection is $\\frac{5}{6} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$."
