        "text": "Step 3: Calculate $\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b}$:\n\\[\n\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b} = 2(1) + y(-2) + (-5)(1) = 2 - 2y - 5 = -3 - 2y.\n\\]"
